\title{Swarm monotypes}
\tag{swarm}
\tag{note}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{Swarm monotypes #{\tau} consist of:}

\ul{
  \li{Command types.  The type \Cmd{\Phi}{\tau} represents commands which can be executed in [requirement context](000X) #{\Phi} and result in a value of type #{\tau}.}
}
